;; Version  : Full SUMO axioms; +1 denotes FOF formulation 1.
;; English  : Compose BadwaterBasin -> DeathValley -> MojaveDesert and propagate the survey camp location.
;;
;; Refs     :
;; Source   : SUMO Geography.kif and full SUMO
;; Names    : SMO_GEG_0002
;;
